  "body": "@agriggio I haven't tried the installer yet. The logs are beyond me as a diagnostic tool, but thanks for making them available. I wish Windows did a better job explaining why it's blocking the exe. \n\nOut of curiosity, I looked for additional portable versions. Under the nightly heading in the releases, I found 2 portable versions. The one labelled as e13622e (3 weeks old) runs without the warning. The other one labelled 6f5ee3c (2 weeks old), triggers the alert as I previously described.\n\n",
